**OVERALL: PASS (scope)** — SPRINT **6.1** is **emit/check SECRET**. The C runtime env surface is a **different** floor (`oo_process_policy_getenv` + exec child inherit + `oo_env_get`). Emit **does** list `env_set` (source, ELF, live refuse).

Do **not** greenwash: there is **no** product `oo_env_set`. Clean `env_set` calls die at `ERR\tc_emit\tunknown free call needs annotation\tenv_set` (fail-closed residual, CAPS_MATRIX). `oodac check` on those fixtures never reaches `ERR\tsecret` because `env_set` is not a typed product symbol. `diag_json.oo` help text still omits `env_set`.

